# Zenos yae Galvus in a game of three. On turn 4 Bot1 casts Zenos and chooses Bot2's Ornithopter, then Lightning Bolts it: "When
# the chosen creature leaves the battlefield, transform Zenos yae Galvus." As it transforms into Shinryu, Transcendent Rival (an
# 8/8 flier), Bot1 chooses an opponent, Bot3 (CR 712.20); Bot1 itself is no choice. Bot1 Bolts Bot3, at 3 life: Bot3 loses, and
# Burning Chains ("When the chosen player loses the game, you win the game", CR 603.10f) triggers and resolves with Bot1 and Bot2
# left: Bot1 wins.

[Life]
Bot3: 3

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Zenos yae Galvus
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest x20

